---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SectionLabel from "../components/SectionLabel.astro";

const topics = [
	"Whether this industry is right for you — and which role fits",
	"Finding your feet in a first role",
	"Growing into senior and staff engineering",
	"Technical leadership, with or without management",
	"Architecture and systems thinking",
	"Hard career decisions",
];

const col = "mx-auto max-w-[700px] px-5";
const prose = "text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-pretty text-ink-soft";
---

<Layout title="Mentoring — Lawrence Job" crumbs={[{ label: "Mentoring" }]}>
	<header class:list={[col, "pt-[clamp(56px,8vw,110px)]"]}>
		<h1 class="font-display text-[clamp(38px,5vw,60px)] leading-[1.04] font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink">
			Mentoring
		</h1>
		<p class="mt-6.5 text-[clamp(16.5px,1.6vw,19px)] leading-[1.7] text-pretty text-ink-soft">
			Over the years, people have asked me for advice — and that’s grown into informal mentoring. Engineers and product
			people, from first role through to staff. I’ve been directly involved in the careers of more than thirty people,
			and it’s some of the most fulfilling work I do.
		</p>
	</header>

	<section class:list={[col, "pt-[clamp(40px,6vw,64px)]"]}>
		<SectionLabel class="mb-4.5">Why I do this</SectionLabel>
		<p class={prose}>
			The first half of my career was an accident. I trained as a computer systems engineer — making microchips — and
			ended up in software. I made decisions one step at a time, and I was having a good time, and growing, but there
			was a point where I didn’t really know what was next. I was lucky: I met someone whose advice took a while to
			sink in, and once it did, I could see my path clearly.
		</p>
		<p class:list={[prose, "mt-5"]}>
			I’d like to give people that. But honestly, I also just enjoy seeing people succeed. Sometimes there’s a spark in
			a person they don’t even realise they have — turning that into a direction is extremely fulfilling.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class:list={[col, "pt-[clamp(40px,6vw,64px)]"]}>
		<SectionLabel class="mb-4.5">Who it’s for</SectionLabel>
		<p class={prose}>
			Two kinds of people, mostly. People working out how to <span class="text-ink">get into the industry</span> — or
			whether it’s for them at all. And experienced people working towards <span class="text-ink"
				>senior and staff roles</span
			>, or into technical leadership.
		</p>
		<p class:list={[prose, "mt-5"]}>
			About half the people I’ve mentored are engineers; the other half work in product roles like design and
			ownership. With AI changing how products get built, that distinction matters less than it used to — and getting
			into the industry is more realistic than most people think.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class:list={[col, "pt-[clamp(40px,6vw,64px)]"]}>
		<SectionLabel class="mb-4.5">What it looks like</SectionLabel>
		<p class={prose}>
			Informal. We meet every few weeks — usually coffee in the evening, sometimes an industry meetup. I’m in London;
			in person works best, but video is fine if you’re elsewhere. The agenda is yours. Things we tend to talk about:
		</p>
		<ul class="mt-7 border-t border-hairline">
			{
				topics.map((topic) => (
					<li class="flex items-baseline gap-4 border-b border-hairline py-4 text-base text-ink-soft">
						<span class="flex-none text-[13px] text-copper" aria-hidden="true">
							·
						</span>
						{topic}
					</li>
				))
			}
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section class:list={[col, "pt-[clamp(40px,6vw,64px)] pb-[clamp(56px,8vw,96px)]"]}>
		<SectionLabel class="mb-4.5">Getting in touch</SectionLabel>
		<p class:list={[prose, "mb-5"]}>
			Message me on LinkedIn — say where you are and what you’re working towards. Nothing formal. I keep this small so
			I can do it properly, and right now I’m fairly full — but reach out anyway. If I can make it work, I will.
		</p>

		<a
			href="https://linkedin.com/in/lawrencejob"
			target="_blank"
			rel="noopener"
			class="tile flex items-center justify-between gap-6 px-[clamp(20px,3vw,36px)] py-7"
		>
			<span class="font-display text-[clamp(19px,2vw,23px)] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink">
				Say hello on LinkedIn
			</span>
			<span class="text-xl text-ink-soft" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
		</a>
	</section>
</Layout>
